{
    "chapter_num": 2,
    "verses_count": 29,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "God’s Righteous Judgment"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore you are inexcusable, O man, whoever you are who judge, for in whatever you judge another you condemn yourself; for you who judge practice the same things. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But we know that the judgment of God is according to truth against those who practice such things. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And do you think this, O man, you who judge those practicing such things, and doing the same, that you will escape the judgment of God? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Or do you despise the riches of His goodness, forbearance, and longsuffering, not knowing that the goodness of God leads you to repentance? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But in accordance with your hardness and your "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "unrepentant"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "impenitent heart you are "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "storing"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "treasuring up for yourself wrath in the day of wrath and revelation of the righteous judgment of God, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“will render to each one according to his deeds”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ": "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "eternal life to those who by patient continuance in doing good seek for glory, honor, and immortality; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "but to those who are self-seeking and do not obey the truth, but obey unrighteousness—indignation and wrath, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "tribulation and anguish, on every soul of man who does evil, of the Jew first and also of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Gentile"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Greek; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "but glory, honor, and peace to everyone who works what is good, to the Jew first and also to the Greek. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For there is no partiality with God."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For as many as have sinned without law will also perish without law, and as many as have sinned in the law will be judged by the law "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "(for not the hearers of the law "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " just in the sight of God, but the doers of the law will be justified; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "for when Gentiles, who do not have the law, by nature do the things in the law, these, although not having the law, are a law to themselves, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "who show the work of the law written in their hearts, their conscience also bearing witness, and between themselves "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "their"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " thoughts accusing or else excusing "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "them"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ") "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "in the day when God will judge the secrets of men by Jesus Christ, according to my gospel."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Jews Guilty as the Gentiles"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU But if"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Indeed you are called a Jew, and rest"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "rely"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on the law, and make your boast in God, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and know "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "His"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " will, and approve the things that are excellent, being instructed out of the law, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and are confident that you yourself are a guide to the blind, a light to those who are in darkness, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "an instructor of the foolish, a teacher of babes, having the form of knowledge and truth in the law. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "You, therefore, who teach another, do you not teach yourself? You who preach that a man should not steal, do you steal? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "You who say, “Do not commit adultery,” do you commit adultery? You who abhor idols, do you rob temples? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "You who make your boast in the law, do you dishonor God through breaking the law? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“the name of God is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "blasphemed among the Gentiles because of you,”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " as it is written."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Circumcision of No Avail"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For circumcision is indeed profitable if you keep the law; but if you are a breaker of the law, your circumcision has become uncircumcision. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, if an uncircumcised man keeps the righteous requirements of the law, will not his uncircumcision be counted as circumcision? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And will not the physically uncircumcised, if he fulfills the law, judge you who, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "even"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "your"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. letter"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "written "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "code"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and circumcision, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a transgressor of the law? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For he is not a Jew who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is one"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " outwardly, nor "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " circumcision that which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " outward in the flesh; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "but "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "he is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a Jew who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is one"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " inwardly; and circumcision "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the heart, in the Spirit, not in the letter; whose "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "A play on words—Jew is literally praise."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "praise "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " not from men but from God."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}